    "body": "This conflicts with `main` (label `conflicts`): `crates/app/src/geometry/import/step.rs` - the same function changed on both sides. PR #1079 (merged at 23c62044) added `super::step_depth::check(data)?` at the top of `parse_with_chord` (the #1075 nesting-cap refusal); this branch renames that function to `parse_with_chord_budget(data, budget)`. Please merge upstream/main and keep both: the budget signature AND the depth check call inside it (and check the #1075 pinning tests still refuse through the budget path). Not resolving it here, as a wrong resolution could silently drop the new refusal.\n",
